                        "sense_id": "3757fc43-2598-3ec9-bf5c-dc5de64b0930",
                        "entry_id": "927c633a-782c-37b7-8356-2bddbace416a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To impose ahead of time."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6acd91f-4cf5-4e6c-ae2c-5596e9184102",
                                "sense_id": "3757fc43-2598-3ec9-bf5c-dc5de64b0930",
                                "text": "Indeed, the application of such procedures to raw data to produce dose-response curves tor examination and extrapolation tends to preimpose linearity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "972557dc-e7f0-4acb-a182-90e7ce7eb4cf",
                                "sense_id": "3757fc43-2598-3ec9-bf5c-dc5de64b0930",
                                "text": "It furthermore confirms, as James A. Davies has shown, that when drawn to contemporaries, Forster did not preimpose ideas upon his material as he did with those of the past, but presented 'honest revelation' bordering on explicitness."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef7584b9-a363-4fc9-ab79-2ec6f3402a7f",
                                "sense_id": "3757fc43-2598-3ec9-bf5c-dc5de64b0930",
                                "text": "Do not preimpose a subtopical order. Do not worry if a question seems repetitive; you will sort that out a bit later."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
